MaiPai moves pack (PKG-MOVES-01)
Third-Party Licenses and Attributions

This package ships no motion files. Its index points at recorded moves from two datasets by Pollen Robotics,
published on Hugging Face under the Apache-2.0 license (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- reachy-mini-emotions-library, revision 873ae49f0b89114b7e535eff0c1f7560d21d9357
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-emotions-library
- reachy-mini-dances-library, revision 3564295e72d41c1271f46bf5540a3fcad9d5f669
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-dances-library

Credit to Pollen Robotics and Hugging Face. When the pack is installed, Home downloads each file at the pinned
revision, checks its sha256 against this package's index, and serves it to the robot unchanged (clips that fail the
robot's envelope check are excluded, never edited). The move format and the community moves tag
(reachy_mini_community_moves) are Pollen's.
